<div id="urduTextPath">امام حسن عسکری (ع)/شہرہ جہان میں حسنِ عسکری کا ہے</div>

<p>shora jahaan me hassan-e askari ka hai<br />
naqsha nagee'n ye arsh ki angushtari ka hai<br />
kounain me ye gul chaman-e hyderi ka hai<br />
durr-e yateem maadan-e paighambari ka hai</p>

<p>mazlumiyat misaale janaab-e hussain hai<br />
aur dabdabe me faatahe badr-o hunain hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>par motemad ne qehr kiya waa musibata<br />
aise wali ko zehar diya waa musibata<br />
imaa'n ke ghar ko loot liya waa musibata<br />
qoone jigar haram ne piya waa musibata</p>

<p>phaada kafan nabi ne ali nange sar huwe<br />
bachpan me haye mahdi-e dee'n be pidar huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>arwaahe panjetan ko sataaya hazaar haif<br />
jannat me mustafa ko rulaaya hazaar haif<br />
turbat se fatima ko uthaaya hazaar haif<br />
qabr-e shah-e najaf ko hilaaya hazaar haif</p>

<p>ghul saamere me hota tha jis waqt bain ka<br />
yaa'n karbala me hilta tha marqad hussain ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hairaa'n the zaayeraan-e hussaini ke kya hai aaj<br />
kyu zalzale me qabr-e shah-e karbala hai aaj<br />
mehshar miyaane ganj-e shaheedaa'n bapaa hai aaj<br />
aati hai ye sadaa hame sadma badaa hai aaj</p>

<p>zaqmi badan ko mere adoo ne hilaa diya<br />
pote ko mere zehre halahal pilaa diya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hairat hai kyu zamee'n pe na arshe ulaa giraa<br />
is zulm se ammaama-e mushkil kushaa giraa<br />
abbasiyo'n pe kyu na falak jaabajaa giraa<br />
baalaa-e qaak taaj-e rasoole quda giraa</p>

<p>sar apna khole sog me aal-e rasool ne<br />
jannat me sar se phaink di chaadar batool ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likha hai jab imaam huwe aazim-e jinaa'n<br />
ek dafaa saamere me qayaamat huwi ayaa'n<br />
doulat saraa-e shaah se aane lagi fughaa'n<br />
lo momino yateem huwe saaheb-uz zamaa'n</p>

<p>sar garm zulm chaaro'n taraf bad qisaal hai<br />
aur haif hai ke mahdi-e dee'n qurd saal hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saaya na baap ka na koi bhaai saath hai<br />
sar par imaam-e asr ke bas haq ki zaat hai<br />
is bepidar ki simt kise iltefaat hai<br />
ab sharm ehle bait ki zahra ke haath hai</p>

<p>laashe ke gird shor jo nouhe ka hota tha<br />
masoom phoot phoot ke baba ko rota tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab is tarha se ehle qabar karte hai bayaa'n<br />
maatam saraa me bibiyaa'n karti thi ye fughaa'n<br />
nehla chuke jo laasha-e moulaa-e do jahaa'n<br />
kafnaaya usko raqte mutahir ke darmiyaa'n</p>

<p>aawaaz aayi fatima ke shor-o shain ki<br />
sab shiyaa roye bekafani par hussain ki<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>